### PUBLIC ROUTES

### Get all FAQs
GET http://localhost:5000/api/faqs
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Search FAQs
GET http://localhost:5000/api/faqs?search=stipend
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get single FAQ by slug (and increment viewCount)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/faqs/what-is-vicharanashala
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Vote on FAQ (Replace :id with real FAQ _id)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/faqs/:id/vote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "voteType": "helpful"
}

###

### Submit a public question
POST http://localhost:5000/api/questions/submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "question": "When will the next batch start?",
  "category": "Timing",
  "submitterName": "Sai Teja",
  "submitterEmail": "sai@example.com"
}


### ----------------------------------------------------
### ADMIN ROUTES (Requires Admin Auth Cookie/Bearer Token)
### ----------------------------------------------------

### Get all FAQs (including unpublished and deleted)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/faqs
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Create an FAQ
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/faqs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "section": "About",
  "sectionNumber": 1,
  "question": "What is Vicharanashala?",
  "answer": "It is a crowd-sourced learning and internship platform.",
  "tags": ["about", "intro"],
  "isPublished": true
}

###

### Edit an FAQ (Replace :id with real FAQ _id)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/admin/faqs/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answer": "It is an updated learning and internship platform."
}

###

### Soft delete an FAQ (Replace :id with real FAQ _id)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/admin/faqs/:id
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Get all submitted questions queue
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/questions
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Update/Approve a submitted question (Replace :id with real Question _id)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/admin/questions/:id
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "aiGeneratedAnswer": "The next batch will start in July."
}

###

### Get dashboard stats
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/stats
Content-Type: application/json
